Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.00,0:00:03.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么我们会在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why were we here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.98,0:00:06.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要像个听话的小兵一样乖乖地遵从老爸的命令吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you follow dad's words like a good, little soldier?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.64,0:00:08.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以不顾一切就为了得到他的认可\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you that desperate for his approval?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.27,0:00:09.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是你的本意  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't you talking, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.37,0:00:10.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你我的不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the difference between you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.78,0:00:13.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有自己的想法  我不像你那么可悲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a mind of my own. I'm not pathetic like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.67,0:00:15.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老爸去世前告诉了我一些事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before dad died, he told me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.81,0:00:17.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他说我有可能会杀了你  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said that I might have to kill you, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.35,0:00:19.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-这到底是什么意思  - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell is that supposed to mean? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.55,0:00:20.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在谈论科尔特  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're talking about the colt, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.98,0:00:24.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你仍打算那个疯狂的猎杀恶魔任务的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you are still set on the insane task of killing the devil,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.35,0:00:25.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就得这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is how we do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.79,0:00:27.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你们在玩LARP  对吧  - 你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You guys are larping, aren't you?  - Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.46,0:00:28.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真人角色扮演\N{\fnArial\fs30}Live-action role-playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.69,0:00:30.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你们是粉丝  - 什么粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're fans.  - Fans of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.23,0:00:32.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡佛·爱德兰德的《凶鬼恶灵》\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Supernatural" by carver edlund.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.16,0:00:34.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他叫是恰克·雪利  他是个天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name's chuck shurley. And he's a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.53,0:00:35.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是迪恩  这是萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm dean. This is sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.70,0:00:37.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是你书里写的那个迪恩和萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dean and sam you've been writing about.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.33,0:00:39.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我写下了那些东西  然后他们成真了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I write things and then they come to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.04,0:00:40.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-显然我是上帝  - 他是上帝的先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Obviously I'm a god. - He's a prophet of the lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.00,0:00:42.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你  你是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You. You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.71,0:00:44.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡佛·爱德兰德  对  嗨  贝基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carver edlund, yeah. Hi, becky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.04,0:00:46.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是你的头号粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am your number-one fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.31,0:00:48.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我知道《凶鬼恶灵》只是一本书  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know that "Supernatural" is just a book, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.51,0:00:50.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-贝基  那全是真实的  - 我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Becky, it's all real. - I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:51.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗  女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay, lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.82,0:00:54.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  这真的是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam...Is it really you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.39,0:00:58.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真结实\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're so firm. Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.11,0:01:21.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.34,0:01:29.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恰克  你在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chuck! there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.62,0:01:30.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.59,0:01:31.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.62,0:01:32.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.79,0:01:35.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道的  我只是在这儿随便走走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, just, um, I was kind of hangin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.46,0:01:36.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们来这里干吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you guys doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.89,0:01:38.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你叫我们来的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told us to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.20,0:01:39.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.86,0:01:41.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有  你发消息给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you did. You texted me --
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.20,0:01:43.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个地址  “生死攸关的情况”\N{\fnArial\fs30}This address, "life-or-death situation."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.03,0:01:44.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有让你想起什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any of this ringing a bell?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.37,0:01:46.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我没有给你发过消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, i-i-i didn't send you a text.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.24,0:01:47.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们整晚都在开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}We drove all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.57,0:01:49.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉  我不知道怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I-i-i don't understand what could --
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.98,0:01:52.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-噢 不  - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, no.  - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.38,0:01:55.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  你来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam! you made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.22,0:02:00.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,贝基  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Becky, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.75,0:02:03.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. You remembered.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.79,0:02:06.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一直想着我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been thinking about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.29,0:02:08.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.13,0:02:09.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.49,0:02:11.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也没有忘记你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't get you out of my head, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.13,0:02:12.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你用过我的电话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, did you take my phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.76,0:02:15.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从你的裤子里拿的  只是借用了下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just borrowed it. From your pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.27,0:02:17.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-贝基  - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Becky. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.43,0:02:18.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们也会想要看到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna want to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.00,0:02:19.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-看什么  - 看什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- See what? - See what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.90,0:02:21.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢  天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.34,0:02:23.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱死他们同时说话的时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love it when they talk at the same time!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.74,0:02:26.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恰克  过来哥们  该你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, chuck! come on, pal. It's showtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.85,0:02:29.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哥们  我为这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.02,0:02:32.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说一声抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}For everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.17,0:02:50.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  你看上去不错嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, dean! lookin' good!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.53,0:02:51.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底是谁啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.00,0:02:54.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm dean, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.95,0:03:05.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是萨姆和迪恩啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-oh. It's sam and dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.18,0:03:07.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在有点麻烦  你们两个玩得开心啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in trouble now. Have fun, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.72,0:03:13.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.20,0:03:27.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,贝基  这是什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Becky, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.30,0:03:28.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.54,0:03:31.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个《凶鬼恶灵》粉丝会  第一次聚会\N{\fnArial\fs30}A "Supernatural" convention. The first ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.20,0:03:57.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来到第一届《凶鬼恶灵》粉丝会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the first annual "Supernatural" convention.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.67,0:04:01.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,屋子里有45名成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}45 in the magnolia room,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.07,0:04:02.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有专业小组\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have the panel
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.71,0:04:06.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有5名男生组成的迪恩私生活小队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five little boy The secret life of dean."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.41,0:04:07.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后在下午的四点半\N{\fnArial\fs30}and four-thirty
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.88,0:04:11.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有一场关于《凶鬼恶灵》的同人活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's the homoerotic subtext of "Supernatural."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.08,0:04:14.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在晚上七点我们的作者会表演节目哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,and caused big hands stars at 7:00 p.m show.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.39,0:04:18.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  不过现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, but -- but right now --
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.86,0:04:21.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我很高兴介绍作者本人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now I'd like to introduce the man himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.73,0:04:26.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,, 《凶鬼恶灵》系列丛书的创作人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The creator and the writer of the "Supernatural" books,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.53,0:04:29.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他就是独一无二的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one, the only...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.10,0:04:30.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡佛·爱德兰德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carver edlund!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.78,0:04:47.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, okay, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.12,0:04:49.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看上去还不是那么笨拙\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't nearly as awkward as I --
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.39,0:04:51.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有点口干\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a little dry mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.01,0:05:12.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.91,0:05:14.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么  我觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I guess, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.61,0:05:15.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来提问吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.32,0:05:19.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.85,0:05:22.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好  爱德兰德先生  我是你的超级粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, mr. Edlund. Uh, big fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.92,0:05:25.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Okay. I was just wondering --
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.41,0:05:28.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你最初是怎么想出萨姆和迪恩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you come up with sam and dean in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.03,0:05:32.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, uh, i, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.36,0:05:34.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就这么想出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just...Came to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.20,0:05:38.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.44,0:05:40.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下一个是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, the, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.04,0:05:41.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有钩子的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hook man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.04,0:05:44.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么在任何打斗场景里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, in every fight scene,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.01,0:05:47.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆和迪恩都用他们的枪或是小刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam and dean are having their gun or knife
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.04,0:05:48.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,干掉那些坏家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knocked away by the bad guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.55,0:05:51.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么他们不用些新武器呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't they keep it on some kind of bungee?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.78,0:05:55.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我  我  我真的不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, i-i-i really don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.15,0:05:56.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, follow-up --
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.85,0:05:59.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为何萨姆和迪恩看不出露比来者不善\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why can't Sam and Dean be telling that Ruby is evil?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.29,0:06:01.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  她明显是在用道德陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, she is clearly manipulating Sam
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.29,0:06:03.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来利用萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Into some kind of moral lapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.89,0:06:05.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,显而易见的事儿啊  不是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's obvious, nein?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.30,0:06:08.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不喜欢这书  那你就别看  怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! If you don't like the books, don't read 'em, fritz!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.47,0:06:10.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay, just, uh --
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.07,0:06:12.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.57,0:06:14.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下一个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, so, next question.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.70,0:06:17.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, uh, y-yeah, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.54,0:06:19.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在上一本书的最后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, at the end of the last book,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.81,0:06:20.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩下地狱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean goes to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.01,0:06:23.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那接着会发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what happens next?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.15,0:06:27.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  据通知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, w-well, there lies an announcement, a-actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.75,0:06:31.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结局很快会揭晓的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're all gonna find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.19,0:06:36.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多亏了阔绰的斯堪的纳维亚投资商\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, thanks to a wealthy scandinavian investor...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.06,0:06:37.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们将会继续出版下一本\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna start publishing again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.54,0:06:49.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的上帝  太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet lord, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.75,0:06:59.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我给你拿了杯冰镇黄眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you a yellow-eyed cooler.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.22,0:07:00.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  恰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Chuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.62,0:07:02.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.35,0:07:05.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,贝基\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Becky, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.52,0:07:07.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在想  你有没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was wondering, um, are you doing anyth--
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.52,0:07:09.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hi, Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.49,0:07:11.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打扰一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.90,0:07:14.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给你提个醒  我们自己的烂摊子都成一堆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In case you haven't noticed, our plates are kind of full.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.76,0:07:17.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,寻找科尔特  猎杀恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? Finding the colt, hunting the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.57,0:07:19.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们没时间耗在这个烂地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have time for this crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.14,0:07:20.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可没叫你来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I didn't call you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.84,0:07:22.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是说那些书  恰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}He means the books, Chuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.57,0:07:23.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么还要出书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you publishing more books?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.01,0:07:26.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为了生存啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, for food and shelter?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.28,0:07:28.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁给你权利来写我们的生活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who gave you the rights to our life story?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.91,0:07:30.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大天使啊  我也不想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}An archangel. And I didn't want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.01,0:07:32.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  放弃吧  别再出书了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, deal's off, okay? No more books.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.92,0:07:34.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的生活不是大众消费品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our lives are not for public consumption.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.26,0:07:41.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,贝基  我们先离开一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Becky, would you excuse us for just a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.20,0:07:47.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们知道我是以何为生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you guys know what I do for a living?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.26,0:07:48.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们知道啊  恰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Chuck, we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.53,0:07:50.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那告诉我好吗  我没头绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, could you tell me? 'cause I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.37,0:07:51.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是一个好作家\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'm not a good writer,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.67,0:07:53.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也没有赚大钱的本事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got no marketable skills,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.64,0:07:55.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不是那些东奔西走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not some hero who can just hit the road
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.27,0:07:57.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,猎杀恶魔的英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}And fight monsters, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.34,0:08:00.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,待到世界末日之前  我还得生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until the world ends, I got to live, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.51,0:08:02.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就只剩下《凶鬼恶灵》了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the "Supernatural" books are all I've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.61,0:08:04.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们还想要我做啥啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.59,0:08:10.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别  伙计们  等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Guys! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.06,0:08:15.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,女士  你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, lady. Hey, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.59,0:08:17.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-没事  - 发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think so. - What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.23,0:08:19.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我看见了一个鬼魂  - 鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I saw a ghost. - A ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.83,0:08:21.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小姐  能描述一下它是什么模样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am, could you tell us what it looked like?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.56,0:08:23.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老兄  何不让成年人来解决这些问题呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you leave this to the grown-ups, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.33,0:08:24.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.53,0:08:26.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她穿着老式的裙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was in an old-fashioned dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.20,0:08:27.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很古老\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really old.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.64,0:08:29.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像一个女教师或别的什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a schoolmarm or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.21,0:08:30.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她跟你说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did she say something to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.87,0:08:32.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.81,0:08:34.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,靠拢来  各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gather close, everybody,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.64,0:08:36.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是一个可怕的恐怖故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a terrifying tale of terror!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.98,0:08:40.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看见的这个鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.18,0:08:45.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,正是拉缇西亚·高尔的鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}None other than the ghost of Leticia Gore herself!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.31,0:08:48.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当我在三楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was on the third floor when I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.09,0:08:50.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,LARP已经开始了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh, the larping's started.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.53,0:08:52.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又搞什么飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}The -- what is that again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.43,0:08:54.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真人秀角色扮演  一个游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Live-action role-playing. It's a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.33,0:08:55.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这次粉丝会的节目\N{\fnArial\fs30}The convention puts it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.04,0:09:00.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他冰冷的  令我怕得要命\N{\fnArial\fs30}...Terror gripping my heart with its icy...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.77,0:09:03.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老爸的日记  亲爱的萨姆  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}"dad's journal -- dear Sam and Dean,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.04,0:09:06.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个旅馆闹鬼  你们得找到鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}"this hotel is haunted. You must hunt down the ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.54,0:09:08.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去问问目击者  找出端倪\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Interview witnesses, discover clues,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.45,0:09:09.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最后找到尸骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}"and find the bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.71,0:09:14.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,先找到的组将获得50美元时时乐(美国牛排店)礼物卷\N{\fnArial\fs30}"First team to do so wins a $50 gift card to sizzler.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.08,0:09:16.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爱你们的爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love, dad."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.19,0:09:18.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩一定获胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys are so gonna win.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.16,0:09:24.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么呢  是的  列农探员  麦卡缇探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, yes, agents Lennon and Mccartney,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.56,0:09:26.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,作为这个公司的管理人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}As manager of this fine establishment,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.86,0:09:30.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能确信这里确实闹鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can assure you that it is indeed haunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.80,0:09:33.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里曾经是一个孤儿院\N{\fnArial\fs30}This building was once an orphanage
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.34,0:09:36.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,由老拉缇西亚·高尔管理着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run by mean, old Leticia Gore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.31,0:09:39.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,100年前的这个晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}100 years ago this very night,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.38,0:09:41.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,高尔老师发疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Gore went insane
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.41,0:09:45.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她自杀前活活杀死了四个男孩儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And butchered four little boys Before killing herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.25,0:09:49.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,传说这四个可怜的小男孩儿的魂魄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now folks say that the souls of those poor, little boys
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.29,0:09:50.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都被困在了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are trapped here
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.72,0:09:54.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,高尔老师邪恶的灵魂在今天这个特别的日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that the evil spirit of miss Gore punishes them
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.32,0:09:57.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,惩  罚  他  们\N{\fnArial\fs30}To this...Very...Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.96,0:10:00.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不就是些社区剧院的手法吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's just about all the community theater
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.06,0:10:01.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我忍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can take.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.60,0:10:03.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  这不能再诡异了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, this cannot get any weirder.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.60,0:10:04.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爸说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad said --
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.44,0:10:06.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,万不得已我能杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said I may have to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.00,0:10:08.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.27,0:10:10.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到底什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.07,0:10:11.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.81,0:10:18.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我要喝点东西  - 我要喝点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I need a drink.  - I need a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.52,0:10:23.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鬼魂探测器有反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}The emf's going nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.66,0:10:34.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是真的  老拉缇西亚·高尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm mean, old Leticia Gore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.40,0:10:36.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们把我埋在了地下室\N{\fnArial\fs30}They buried me in the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.90,0:10:42.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你打到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow. You got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.04,0:10:44.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该消失才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're supposed to vanish.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.94,0:10:46.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要怎么消失啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How am I supposed to vanish?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.18,0:10:50.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的  迪恩  5分钟后见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, okay, Dean. We'll see you in five.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.48,0:10:53.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过说真的  别吃我的彩虹糖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, but seriously, dude, don't eat my skittles.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.18,0:10:54.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救救我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.55,0:11:00.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救救我们  高尔老师不让我们玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help us. Miss Gore won't let us have any fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.86,0:11:04.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这也是游戏吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is part of the game, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.53,0:11:07.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy mother of crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.64,0:11:20.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那  确实是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That...Was --
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.59,0:11:31.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不听话  不听话  不听话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naughty! naughty! naughty!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.00,0:12:00.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.20,0:12:01.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,忙着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.14,0:12:04.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  你今晚真可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you sure look lovely tonight,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.13,0:12:06.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尤其是扮成死了的小妞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially for a dead chick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.57,0:12:10.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老兄  这句话我今晚听17遍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy, I have heard that line 17 times tonight, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.42,0:12:14.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且都是穿的和你一样的人说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all from dudes wearing macgyver jackets.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.31,0:12:19.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你不太一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you seem different.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.92,0:12:21.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How so?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.28,0:12:22.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看来不会被女人吓到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you don't seem scared of women.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.79,0:12:25.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再说最后一遍  不是我编的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the last time, I'm not making this up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.37,0:12:28.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她  她就在楼上  一个真正的  活生生的鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}She -- she's upstairs. A real, live, dead ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.22,0:12:29.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,失陪一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.76,0:12:31.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  我确定那只是一个演员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm sure it was just one of the actors.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.25,0:12:33.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那又是谁揍了我一顿又消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who beat the crap out of me and then vanished?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.66,0:12:34.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看见什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw something?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.80,0:12:36.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这绝不是游戏  笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, this isn't part of the game, jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.43,0:12:39.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蒂姆  我要走了  你最好跟我一起离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tim, I'm getting out of here, and you should do the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.34,0:12:42.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾历克斯 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex, wait. I --
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.37,0:12:43.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.84,0:12:46.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.48,0:12:49.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得那家伙不是装出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think that guy's a good enough actor to be acting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.28,0:12:52.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  扎格和理查德探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, yes, agents jagger and richards,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.58,0:12:55.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,作为这里的经理\N{\fnArial\fs30}As the manager of this fine establishment,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.08,0:12:58.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我负责任的告诉你们这里确实在闹鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can assure you it is indeed haunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.62,0:13:00.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个楼曾经是个孤儿院\N{\fnArial\fs30}The building was once an orphanage
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.62,0:13:03.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,由老拉缇西亚·高尔管理着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run by mean, old Leticia Gore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.01,0:13:06.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打扰一下  我们能问几个问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse us. Mind if we ask you a few questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.50,0:13:08.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伙计  我可没空陪你们玩星战游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't have time to play "star wars," guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.66,0:13:10.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去问戴围巾那人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ask the guy in the ascot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.64,0:13:13.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,实际上我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, we, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.37,0:13:16.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常想问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really want to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.14,0:13:18.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你们真是太投入了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. You guys are really into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.61,0:13:20.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会了解的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.31,0:13:22.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想知道什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.11,0:13:23.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们说的那些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this stuff they're saying --
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.51,0:13:24.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闹鬼的地方 拉缇西亚·高尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Place being haunted, Leticia Gore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.95,0:13:27.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些是真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any truth to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.18,0:13:29.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们通常不愿意公开宣传这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}We generally don't like to publicize this
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.22,0:13:30.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不愿意让大众知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}To, you know, normal people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.99,0:13:35.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但1909年这里是高尔孤儿院的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, yeah, in 1909, this place was called Gore orphanage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.29,0:13:38.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,高尔小姐用切肉刀杀了四个男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss gore killed four boys with a butcher knife,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.69,0:13:40.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后自杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then offed herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.16,0:13:41.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么今天确实是周年纪念\N{\fnArial\fs30}And is tonight really the anniversary?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.76,0:13:43.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  我猜你们的活动需要真实感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. Guess your convention folks wanted authenticity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.40,0:13:48.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有过什么异常吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There been any sightings?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.07,0:13:49.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,前几年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, over the years, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.47,0:13:50.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有几个女佣辞职了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few maids have quit,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.02,0:13:54.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她们说听到或者见到了那些孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saying they heard the boys or saw them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.31,0:13:55.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个看门人甚至看见高尔小姐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A janitor even saw miss Gore once.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.88,0:13:58.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,高尔小姐在哪杀的他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did miss Gore carve up the kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.05,0:14:01.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你们在这到处走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't want you stomping all over the joint.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.48,0:14:03.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里很多地方是闲人免进的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of this place is off-limits to nerds.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.96,0:14:12.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在阁楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The attic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.95,0:14:39.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鬼魂探测器抽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The emf's going nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.69,0:14:42.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.99,0:14:44.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,确实有个鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we got a real ghost,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.49,0:14:46.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有一堆傻帽装成咱们俩在找\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a bunch of dudes, pretending to be us, poking at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.93,0:14:49.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,简直是胡来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way this ends well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.67,0:14:52.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗  他们活该\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? Serves them right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.47,0:14:53.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.90,0:14:56.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说说而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm just saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.09,0:15:11.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是这附近动某个地方了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got to be around here someplace.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.82,0:15:13.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道哎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I don't know, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.59,0:15:15.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没别人在找阁楼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one else is looking for the attic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.59,0:15:17.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, all right, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.66,0:15:20.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,首先  进入角色  行不\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, stay in character, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.06,0:15:22.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有我当真的话  看起来很傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's just me, I look stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.30,0:15:25.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第二  你听见楼下那人说的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, two, you heard the guy downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.33,0:15:28.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得这是游戏的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think this is part of the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.34,0:15:30.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.84,0:15:33.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  我的天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.91,0:15:36.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妆画得太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That makeup is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.08,0:15:37.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这外行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amateur.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.25,0:15:39.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,注意  你的  角色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay...In...Character.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.92,0:15:42.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.48,0:15:45.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮帮我们  高尔小姐不让我们玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help us. Miss Gore won't let us have any fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.69,0:15:47.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尸体埋在哪了  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the body buried, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.46,0:15:50.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会把她彻彻底底的烧掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll light her up nice and toasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.26,0:15:51.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.57,0:16:05.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跑的真快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Fast runner.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.11,0:16:06.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.94,0:16:09.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.45,0:16:14.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  真恐怖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that is creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.82,0:16:16.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要按他说的做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must've been what he was trying to tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.89,0:16:19.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得呢  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gee, you think, sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.34,0:16:35.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  这是我见过的最酷的游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, this is the coolest game ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.21,0:16:40.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.47,0:17:07.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我妈妈爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mommy loves me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.01,0:17:13.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说我妈妈爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said my mommy loves me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.88,0:17:16.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我相信她爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure she does.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.45,0:17:18.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我妈妈就这么爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mommy loves me this much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.61,0:17:50.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.18,0:17:52.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.85,0:17:55.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是个本地历史上提到的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a guy with the county historical society.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.68,0:17:56.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.89,0:17:58.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拉缇西亚·高尔不但杀了四个男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not only did Leticia Gore butcher four boys,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.89,0:18:00.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且其中之一是她的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But one of them was her own son.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.82,0:18:02.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-她儿子  - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Her son? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.59,0:18:03.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,根据警察的记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to the police at the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.03,0:18:05.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她扒了那孩子的头皮\N{\fnArial\fs30}She scalped the poor kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.59,0:18:08.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  我要油炸了这抽风的贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's it. I'm gonna deep-fry this bitch extra-crispy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.13,0:18:10.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-知道她埋在哪吗  - 他不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dude say where she was buried? - He doesn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.67,0:18:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.43,0:18:16.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那儿是孤儿院  这儿是马车棚\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's the orphanage, here's the carriage house.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.21,0:18:18.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那儿  就是墓地\N{\fnArial\fs30}And right there, cemetery.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.81,0:18:21.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得拉缇西亚埋在那儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think that's where Leticia's planted?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.78,0:18:23.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,值得去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's worth a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.81,0:18:27.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿  这是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Ooh. Hey, hey! hey, do you mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.35,0:18:28.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是真的  至少一个世纪以前的纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's real. A century old, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.95,0:18:30.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是对的  墓地就在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's right. There is a cemetery on the grounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.89,0:18:32.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这玩意儿哪来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.62,0:18:34.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这叫游戏  朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called a game, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.76,0:18:36.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是慈善捐助\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't called "charity."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.49,0:18:38.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  把地图给我  笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, give me the map, chuckles.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.09,0:18:40.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们才是笨蛋呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're the chuckles...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.30,0:18:41.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chuckles.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.50,0:18:44.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有  迪恩谁的话都不会听的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, Dean don't listen to nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.93,0:18:47.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  冷静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean...Cool it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.04,0:18:48.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.74,0:18:51.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  他们烦死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? They're friggin' annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.54,0:18:53.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  伙计们  我们都想找到骨头  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, guys, we all want to find the bones, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.01,0:18:57.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想  大家合作会快一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just thought it would go faster if we all work together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.38,0:19:02.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,时时乐的礼物卷归我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We, uh, we get the sizzler gift card.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.65,0:19:03.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.95,0:19:05.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆和迪恩的称号也归我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we get to be Sam and Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.39,0:19:08.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.52,0:19:10.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.09,0:19:15.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  鲁佛斯  鲍比  快一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Rufus, Bobby, would you hurry it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.66,0:19:16.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.77,0:19:19.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我尽量\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.70,0:19:20.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们刚才在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, where were we?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.90,0:19:23.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾利卡特医生刚把你杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, dr. Ellicott had just zapped your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.97,0:19:26.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的  知道啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.38,0:19:28.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩 我们为什么还要来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are we even here, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.71,0:19:30.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是只要跟随父亲的脚步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you just follow in dad's footsteps
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.51,0:19:32.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像一个优秀的小兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a good, little soldier?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.35,0:19:34.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就那么想得到认可\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you that desperate for approval?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.15,0:19:35.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆 这不是你的本意\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't you talking, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.48,0:19:37.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你我的区别\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, that's the difference between you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.49,0:19:39.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有自己的想法  我不是可怜虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a mind of my own. I'm not pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.72,0:19:42.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你想怎么做 萨姆 杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are you gonna do, Sam? You gonna kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.39,0:19:44.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伙计  我讨厌你告诉我做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I am so sick of you telling me what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.79,0:19:46.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,够  我受够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you know what? That -- that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.00,0:19:48.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.23,0:19:49.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong, Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.67,0:19:53.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not Bobby, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.97,0:19:55.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.54,0:19:56.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也不是迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.94,0:19:58.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们有毛病吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.34,0:20:01.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们到底为什么想当他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why in the hell would you choose to be these guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.58,0:20:04.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是粉丝啊  就像你们一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we're fans, like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.38,0:20:05.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.51,0:20:08.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是粉丝  好吧  不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not a fan, okay? Not fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.62,0:20:12.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说实话  我觉得迪恩和萨姆的故事烂透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, I think that the "Dean and Sam" story sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.79,0:20:16.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不好玩也没乐趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is not fun. It's not entertaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.33,0:20:18.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个故事糟透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a river of crap
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.06,0:20:20.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,会把大多数人送进精神病院\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would send most people howling to the nuthouse!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.90,0:20:22.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.23,0:20:24.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们的痛苦不是你们的消遣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their pain is not for your amusement.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.23,0:20:25.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  你们认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, do you think that they enjoy
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.80,0:20:29.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们想被当成马戏团小丑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being treated like -- like circus freaks?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.07,0:20:31.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想他们不会在意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I don't think they care,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.07,0:20:34.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为他们是虚构的人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because they're fictional characters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.44,0:20:36.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, they care.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.61,0:20:37.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.01,0:20:39.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们非常在意\N{\fnArial\fs30}They care a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.49,0:20:44.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.56,0:20:49.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他把这个故事当真了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He takes the story really seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.85,0:21:17.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-找到那4个男孩  - 这是拉缇西亚·高尔的墓地\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Found the four boys.  - And here's Leticia Gore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.79,0:21:24.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, what are you guys doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.40,0:21:29.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在找尸骨 天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, we're looking for bones, genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.97,0:21:32.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们应该在这附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got to be around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.63,0:21:35.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一般来说  尸骨是埋在地里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, generally, bones are in the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.01,0:21:37.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.34,0:21:39.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that. I'm just --
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.88,0:21:42.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.81,0:21:46.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你们真要这么做  - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you guys serious? - Deadly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.25,0:21:49.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不会真的挖墓  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're -- we're not really digging up graves, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.22,0:21:51.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只是在玩游戏  所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just playing the game, so --
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.05,0:21:52.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,相信我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.19,0:21:53.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想赢  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to win the game, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.53,0:22:38.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是塑料的尸骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's, uh, not a plastic skeleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.97,0:22:40.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是真的尸骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a skeleton skeleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.74,0:22:42.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们挖的是真的墓\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just dug up a real grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.40,0:22:43.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.68,0:22:49.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们是疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys are nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.98,0:22:51.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我记得你们说过想当猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said you guys wanted to be hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.75,0:22:53.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伙计  猎人不是真实的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunters aren't real, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.55,0:22:55.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-这不是真的  - 上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This isn't real.  - Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.48,0:22:58.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们彻底迷失方向抓住这点牢牢不放了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys have just seriously lost your grip on this --
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.65,0:23:01.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.72,0:23:03.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,淘气  淘气  淘气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naughty! naughty! naughty!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.10,0:23:09.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,巴恩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barnes!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.58,0:23:14.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.97,0:23:17.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,淘气  淘气  淘气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naughty! naughty! naughty!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.99,0:23:39.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,够真实的了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.56,0:24:00.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.81,0:24:02.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.42,0:24:05.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吓人  是吧  就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awful, right? Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.43,0:24:11.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们请\N{\fnArial\fs30}Round's on us, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.40,0:24:12.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等会见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.84,0:24:17.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们怎么知道要这样做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. How did you know how to do all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.98,0:24:20.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.96,0:24:24.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们读了书\N{\fnArial\fs30}We read the books.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.99,0:24:31.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Chuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.76,0:24:34.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,祝《凶鬼恶灵》大卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck with the "Supernatural" books.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.29,0:24:36.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去你妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And screw you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.46,0:24:40.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fans of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.90,0:24:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得说不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. I'd say no.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.74,0:24:53.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.28,0:24:55.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绝对是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.35,0:24:59.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发现什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.65,0:25:01.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每个出口都被锁了  貌似\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every exit's locked. Almost like...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.39,0:25:03.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-有什么东西不让我们出去  - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Something's keeping us in? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.66,0:25:04.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.99,0:25:06.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀  你认为呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gee, you think, sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.13,0:25:11.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要到那里面去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.40,0:25:14.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下楼去  去  去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get downstairs, okay? Go. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.00,0:25:19.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要那样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.17,0:25:21.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么送走我妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you send my mommy away?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.11,0:25:23.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许是因为她给你剃的锅盖头(指头上的伤)\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, maybe because of the high-and-tight she gave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.94,0:25:26.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么不感谢我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? How 'bout some thanks?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.11,0:25:27.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm just saying,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.98,0:25:30.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,偶尔来点感谢就可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little gratitude might be nice once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.68,0:25:32.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈没有这样对我\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mommy didn't do this to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.68,0:25:36.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  那么是谁干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Then, who did?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.47,0:25:50.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多原汁原味啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. How original.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.80,0:25:54.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,, 《凶鬼恶灵》带给你更多的诡异儿童\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Supernatural" bringing you more creepy children.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.14,0:25:54.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可悲啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.78,0:25:57.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,高尔小姐不让我们玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Gore wouldn't let us have any fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.74,0:26:00.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们看上去可一点都不像真的鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look nothing like real ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.48,0:26:02.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就这么告诉你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.38,0:26:03.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是高尔小姐已经走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But miss gore's gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.62,0:26:07.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么现在我们可以尽情享乐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now we can have all kinds of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.99,0:26:15.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gott im himmel!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.44,0:26:31.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  伙计们  我猜我们要接近尾声了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, guys, I guess we're -- we're out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.08,0:26:33.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}So thank you for your incredibly
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.75,0:26:36.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,深入并且缜密的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probing and rigorous questions,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.38,0:26:37.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,祝你们有个愉快的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And have a good --
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.02,0:26:41.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  我靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?! holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.62,0:26:45.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须保证这里人的安全  恰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to keep everyone safe in here, chuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.36,0:26:46.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这可是生死攸关的事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is life-or-death.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.53,0:26:47.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}For how long?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.47,0:26:48.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,需要多久就多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.69,0:26:50.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可我该咋办呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how the hell am I supposed to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.03,0:26:54.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道啊哥们儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.83,0:26:56.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,做就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.71,0:27:03.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.58,0:27:04.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.78,0:27:08.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还有更多要告诉大家的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I got much more to tell you...I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.28,0:27:09.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.85,0:27:12.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哥们儿  我还有工作要做啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy, I got work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.01,0:27:12.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你绝对想看看这个  相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna want to see this. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.98,0:27:15.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这演讲绝对酷毙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be a hell of a show, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.69,0:27:18.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go. Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.82,0:27:22.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然了  也有很多不错的女巫的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certainly, there are a lot of nice witches, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.90,0:27:28.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆和迪恩的命运会如何呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, what does the future hold for sam and dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.30,0:27:31.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你们觉得天使咋样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, uh, how do you feel about angels?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.60,0:27:33.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我跟你们说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you know, because, let me tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.57,0:27:35.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们可一点都不像你们想的那么弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not nearly as lame as you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.78,0:27:38.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  最新消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, new theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.08,0:27:40.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,关于拉缇西亚的传说明显是搞错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The legends about leticia are ass-backwards, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.85,0:27:43.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我们假设那三个孤儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, so, all right, let's say those three orphans
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.68,0:27:46.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是在  是在玩西部牛仔和印第安人的游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were -- were playing cowboys and indians.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.18,0:27:47.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是在角色扮演牛仔和印第安人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Larping as cowboys and indians.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.65,0:27:50.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,随便吧  然后他们剥去了拉缇西亚儿子的头皮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever -- and let's say they scalped leticia's son
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.02,0:27:52.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.32,0:27:54.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈把他们当场抓获  接着她就发疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom catches them in the act, flips out,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.49,0:27:55.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把他们切成片  又把自己了解了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slices them, and dices herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.86,0:27:57.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果这是真的  那意味着\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that's true, it means
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.13,0:27:59.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这楼里面就有三个嗜杀贪玩的小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got three bloodthirsty brats in the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.03,0:28:00.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  在我们除掉她之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and leticia was the only
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.05,0:28:01.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拉缇西亚是唯一一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}One keeping them under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.13,0:28:02.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以管得住他们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until we took her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.21,0:28:02.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能打草惊蛇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smooth move on our part.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.93,0:28:04.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-好的  - 我们得回到墓地去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. - Well, we got to get back to the cemetery
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.87,0:28:06.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后烧了那些小孩的骨头\N{\fnArial\fs30}And torch the kids' bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.20,0:28:08.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么去  我们可被困住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How? We're trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.37,0:28:10.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们连枪都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't even have our guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.31,0:28:11.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些鬼魂在房子里到处乱窜\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ghosts are running this joint,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.61,0:28:13.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且他们只怕一样东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they were only scared of one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.45,0:28:16.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,正解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.68,0:28:18.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想让我干啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.18,0:28:20.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是个演员啊  我们只是想让你演演戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're an actress, okay? We just want you to act.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.49,0:28:22.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在托莱多的猫头鹰餐厅工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I work at hooters in toledo.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.95,0:28:25.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想都别想\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.12,0:28:26.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你绝对安全  我们保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be safe. We promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.66,0:28:28.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是这真的很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this is really important.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.69,0:28:31.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们想帮你们忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.06,0:28:32.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给她点容易的事儿干  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give her the puppy-dog thing, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.67,0:28:33.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伙计们  不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.18,0:28:34.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为啥不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.82,0:28:37.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为这可不是假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because this isn't make-believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.30,0:28:39.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们知道  我们不是疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we know. We're not nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.04,0:28:40.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们也怕的要死\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're freakin' terrified.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.97,0:28:43.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  但是如果这些人真的有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but if all these people are seriously in trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.01,0:28:45.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须做点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.38,0:28:46.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.58,0:28:47.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.85,0:28:49.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆和迪恩会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what sam and dean would do.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.55,0:28:55.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢不  并没有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no, there's really no such thing
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.15,0:28:58.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像是Croatoan病毒一样的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a croatoan virus for, you know, down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.32,0:29:01.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真该去看看医生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really should see a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.07,0:29:15.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我  我真不想这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-i don't want to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.38,0:29:20.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就在这儿  小甜心  我会罩着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm right here, sweetheart. I got your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.24,0:29:23.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,相信我  这绝对有效\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me. This is gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.55,0:29:27.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,男孩们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.85,0:29:30.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,男孩们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.86,0:29:33.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过来  马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here, this instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.74,0:29:48.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫你们的时候你们就得过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You come when I call you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.14,0:29:52.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.01,0:29:54.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,高尔小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss gore?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.95,0:30:01.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快推\N{\fnArial\fs30}Push.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.16,0:30:08.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们这些男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You boys...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.96,0:30:11.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,实在太淘气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have been very naughty.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.91,0:30:16.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在  你们把门打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you open the doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.74,0:30:18.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马上把门打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the doors right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.29,0:30:24.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,继续继续继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.11,0:30:29.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.41,0:30:32.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们都太淘气了  听见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're very naughty. You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.42,0:30:36.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,淘气  淘气  淘气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naughty, naughty, naughty.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.79,0:30:44.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh! damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.62,0:31:13.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.41,0:31:34.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.61,0:31:38.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凶鬼恶灵让挖墓地\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Supernatural" makes digging graves...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.35,0:31:40.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,变得如此容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seem so easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.29,0:31:44.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但完全不是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.65,0:31:46.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要放弃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna throw up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.62,0:31:48.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.21,0:32:11.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.28,0:32:13.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.00,0:32:17.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们看看  还有啥别的不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see. Uh, what else?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.73,0:32:20.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的初恋在16岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fell in love for the first time at 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.37,0:32:24.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上也失去了处子之身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lost my virginity, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.01,0:32:26.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是她却到处告诉别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then she went around telling
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.81,0:32:28.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那并不算数  所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody it didn't count, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.78,0:32:31.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这比较搞笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's kind of funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.01,0:32:34.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh...Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.28,0:32:35.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你  你不能走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-you really can't leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.02,0:32:37.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托了先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.85,0:32:40.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别去开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't open that door!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.32,0:33:10.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说了谁都不能出去  该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said no one leaves, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.58,0:33:12.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在  谁来这门口撒点盐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, somebody salt this door!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.40,0:33:29.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为啥迪恩每次都能一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come dean can always light
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.40,0:33:32.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就点着这白痴一样东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}This stupid thing on the first freakin' try?!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.17,0:33:34.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.41,0:33:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.94,0:34:20.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许那家伙说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}May be that guy is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.38,0:34:24.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们也该换换新武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we should put these things on a bungee.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.67,0:34:38.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不得不感谢你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I got to hand it to you, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.81,0:34:41.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那时多亏你们救了我们的小命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really saved our asses back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.64,0:34:44.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.93,0:34:46.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多谢你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.56,0:34:49.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天  我还不知道你们的名字呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gosh, I don't even know your names.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.93,0:34:51.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是巴恩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Well, I'm Barnes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.60,0:34:52.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是德米安\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Demian.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.00,0:34:54.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.07,0:35:00.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  真正的迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean. The real Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.41,0:35:08.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦哟  才怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.02,0:35:10.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-那我也是  - 开什么玩笑呀  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Me too! - Get the hell out of here, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.09,0:35:16.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎样  还是多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, anyway, uh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.52,0:35:17.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的很感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.96,0:35:22.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗  其实你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wrong, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.90,0:35:25.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.10,0:35:26.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,关于"凶鬼恶灵"的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}About "Supernatural."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.40,0:35:28.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无意冒犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}No offense,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.24,0:35:30.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是我觉得你并没有理解故事的精髓\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm not sure you get what the story's about.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.47,0:35:34.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是那样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.11,0:35:36.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是这样的  现实生活中\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, look, in real life,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.54,0:35:39.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他卖音响设备\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sells stereo equipment,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.61,0:35:41.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而我是修复印机的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fix copiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.58,0:35:44.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的生活糟糕透顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our lives suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.15,0:35:49.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是作为萨姆和迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}But to be sam and dean...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.79,0:35:53.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每天早上醒来  去拯救世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}To wake up every morning and save the world...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.73,0:35:57.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,身边有能与你同生共死的兄弟陪伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}To have a brother who would die for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.80,0:36:00.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这难道不令人羡慕吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, who wouldn't want that?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.17,0:36:05.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you got a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.81,0:36:13.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要知道  你俩合作的也不赖嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know, you two don't make a bad team yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.08,0:36:15.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们怎么认识的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know each other, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.48,0:36:18.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在网上认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, uh, well, we met online.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.49,0:36:21.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"凶鬼恶灵"聊天室\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Supernatural" chat room.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.36,0:36:25.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,离开父母的小巢出去交点朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it must be nice to get out of your parents' basement
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.49,0:36:26.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真很好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And make some friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.96,0:36:29.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不止是朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're more than friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.80,0:36:32.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是伴侣\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.61,0:36:40.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.67,0:36:43.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊  情侣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Howdy, partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.85,0:36:46.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Howdy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.72,0:36:51.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Sam...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.82,0:36:54.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想骗你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.22,0:36:57.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不可否认  我俩有感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had undeniable chemistry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.03,0:37:01.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但就像猴子在太阳上  太热了而不能生存下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}But like a monkey on the sun, it was too hot to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.57,0:37:03.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能再这样下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can't go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.40,0:37:08.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恰克和我之间彼此相识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chuck and I -- we found each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.16,0:37:11.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我为他的英勇刚强所吸引\N{\fnArial\fs30}My yin to his proud yang.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.23,0:37:15.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已心有所属\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, well, the heart wants what the heart wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.14,0:37:20.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我非常抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so, so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.61,0:37:23.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.51,0:37:25.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.18,0:37:29.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会有事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you be all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.29,0:37:38.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说实话  我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.43,0:37:41.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是我想我必须\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll just have to --
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.30,0:37:44.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,另寻他法  继续生活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}To find a way to keep living, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.77,0:37:46.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,愿上帝保佑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}God bless you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.87,0:37:50.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  恰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, um, oh, hey, Chuck,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.84,0:37:53.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你真想再出版新书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if you really want to publish more books,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.18,0:37:55.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们大概也没什么意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess that's okay with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.21,0:37:57.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.35,0:37:58.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然不  我们有枪  会追你到天涯海角\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not really. We have guns, and we'll find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.01,0:38:00.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.68,0:38:02.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会再出书了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more books.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.85,0:38:04.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回头见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.69,0:38:07.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  萨姆  还有件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam! wait! one more thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.19,0:38:12.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,, 《凶鬼恶灵》第三章  "时间为证"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chapter 3 in "Supernatural - Time is on my side,"
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.00,0:38:13.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个叫贝拉的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was that girl bela.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.40,0:38:14.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她是个英国飞贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was british and a cat burglar.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.83,0:38:15.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.90,0:38:17.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她从你们这里偷走了Colt\N{\fnArial\fs30}She stole the Colt from you,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.17,0:38:18.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她还声称把科尔特交给了莉莉丝  记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then she "said" she gave it to lilith, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.90,0:38:20.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.10,0:38:21.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道她在撒谎吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know she lied, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.24,0:38:22.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她从没把科尔特给莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}She never really gave it to lilith.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.57,0:38:24.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.34,0:38:25.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没看书吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't you read the book?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.51,0:38:27.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,的确有这么一个场景\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was this one scene
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.34,0:38:30.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,贝拉把那把枪给了一个叫克罗力的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where bela gives the colt to a demon named Crowley,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.08,0:38:31.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉丝的得力助手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lilith's right-hand man --
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.41,0:38:32.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想大概也是她的情人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think her lover, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.78,0:38:34.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.12,0:38:36.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么之前没想到要告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't occur to you to tell us this before?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.12,0:38:37.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  我不记得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I didn't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.59,0:38:39.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不像她那样痴迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not as big of a fan as she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.52,0:38:41.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,贝基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Becky...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.76,0:38:42.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把来龙去脉都告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.84,0:38:57.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.54,0:38:59.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你猜怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.04,0:39:00.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.24,0:39:01.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会觉得难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're not gonna believe it,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.01,0:39:03.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我找到了关于科尔特的线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I got a lead on the colt.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.35,0:39:04.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.51,0:39:06.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说来话长  路上慢慢说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long story. Tell you on the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.15,0:39:08.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那咱们还等什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.70,0:39:21.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和大多数作家一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a lot of authors,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.40,0:39:23.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是因为爱而开始写作生涯的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I started writing because of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.73,0:39:27.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,南希·麦积翁给了我巨大的打击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I had a huge crush on nancy mckeon,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.07,0:39:29.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她在"生活的真相"这一集中饰演乔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who played Jo on "the facts of life."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.31,0:39:32.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我给她写了四五十封信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must have written her like 40 to 50 letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.38,0:39:33.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她从没回过信\N{\fnArial\fs30}She never wrote back.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.81,0:39:36.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得食人怪没有换上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think the benders made flesh suits
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.08,0:39:38.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有受害者的人皮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of all their victims, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.35,0:39:40.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最多只是用了情侣围巾的材料而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe just like a couple scarves.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.38,0:39:43.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实我最爱的电影是《海滩》（1988年电影）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, my favorite movie was "beaches".
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.32,0:39:45.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希拉里和C.C真是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hillary and C.C. Were just...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.49,0:39:46.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太勇敢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.49,0:39:49.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如此坚强\N{\fnArial\fs30}So strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.76,0:39:50.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way I look at it,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.93,0:39:51.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不打算来个大改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's really not jumping the shark
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.92,0:39:54.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就不算重大转型\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you never come back down, you know?

